# Project agent guide

Before non-trivial work in this repo, read and follow **[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)** at the repository root.

It covers stack layout, verify commands (`typecheck` / `lint` / `format` / `build` / `test:smoke`), `window.__RIFTBORN` + `/?smoke=1`, hub/POI/chest design anchors, and commit/push rules.

Prefer AGENTS.md over inventing parallel workflows. After map or POI changes, run `bun run test:smoke` and use `__RIFTBORN` / `artifacts/hub.png` instead of screenshot-only checks.
